@@ -12,6 +12,12 @@ See the [Contributing Guide](contributing.md) for details.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+* Footnotes are now numbered and ordered by the order of their references
+  rather than their definitions. Set the new `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER` option of
+  the footnotes extension to `True` to restore the old behavior.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 * Fix handling of incomplete HTML tags in code spans in Python 3.14.
